Homepage: https://github.com/tonglingcn/lz-disk-cleaner
Description: Disk cleaning and optimization tool for Deepin
 LZ Disk Cleaner is a comprehensive disk cleaning and system
 optimization tool designed for Deepin V25.
 .
 Main Features:
  - Disk usage analysis with multi-level directory scanning
  - Smart and custom cleanup modes
  - APT source management (add, edit, enable/disable, delete)
  - Startup application management
  - File shredder with secure deletion
  - System slimming (large files, duplicates finder)
  - Hardware resource monitoring (CPU, Memory, Network, GPU)
  - Linglong application management
  - Immutable system (磐石) snapshot support
  - Support for multiple browsers cache cleaning
 .
 This tool helps users reclaim disk space and maintain system
 performance with an intuitive Qt6-based interface.
